      </td></tr></table><table><col class="asyn-l"></col><col class="asyn-r"></col><tr><td>&lt;index&gt;</td><td><a id="index__26"></a>
        
          <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Is the vector segment index, in the range 0 to 7, encoded in the "i3" field.</p>
        
